// solution

class Solution {
public:
int gcdOfOddEvenSums(int n) {
    return n;
}
};


// reason:
Sum of first n odd numbers: 1+3+5+⋯+(2n−1)=n*n


Sum of first n even numbers: 2+4+6+⋯+2n=n(n+1)

Now compute the GCD: gcd(n*n,n(n+1))

Factor out n: =n×gcd(n,n+1)

Since consecutive numbers are always coprime, gcd(n,n+1)=1

Therefore, gcd(n*n,n(n+1))=n
